## 🔹 Amazon ECR + ECS

I also learned how **Amazon ECR (Elastic Container Registry)** works together with ECS.

ECR is used to store Docker container images.

The workflow is:

```text
Developer
    ↓
Docker Build
    ↓
Docker Image
    ↓
Amazon ECR
    ↓
ECS Task Definition
    ↓
ECS Task
    ↓
Container
```

For example:

```text
ECR Repository
└── my-go-app
      ├── v1
      ├── v2
      └── latest
```

The ECS Task Definition references the ECR image, and ECS pulls the image when starting the task.

