## 🔹 Complete ECS Workflow

The complete workflow I learned today can be summarized as:

```text
                    Developer
                       │
                       ↓
                  Dockerfile
                       │
                       ↓
                 Docker Image
                       │
                       ↓
                      ECR
                       │
                       ↓
                ECS Task Definition
                       │
                       ↓
                  ECS Service
                       │
                       ↓
                 Running Tasks
                       │
                       ↓
                   Containers
                       │
                       ↓
               Application Users
```

For a production-style web application:

```text
                    Internet
                       │
                       ↓
                  ALB / DNS
                       │
                       ↓
                  ECS Service
                       │
              ┌────────┼────────┐
              ↓        ↓        ↓
            Task 1   Task 2   Task 3
              │        │        │
              ↓        ↓        ↓
          Container Container Container
```

